  "type": "object",
  "description": "For a given “scope” value, this event is sent after a successful sync (note that every login triggers a sync). It is sent only if the latest sending was more than 24 hours ago for this user on this device.\r\rExample 1 (in the same installation):\r\r 1 - I log in with my first account \r\r 2 - A vault_report event is triggered (assuming it was not triggered on this installation by this user within the past 24 hours)\r\r 3 - I log out\r\r 4 - I log in with my second account \r\r 5 - A vault_report is triggered (assuming it was not triggered on this installation by this user within the past 24 hours)\r\r\r\r Example 2 (with the same user account):\r\r 1 - I log in with my first device \r\r 2 - A vault_report event is triggered \r\r 3 - I log out\r\r 4 - I log in with my second device \r\r 5 - A vault_report is triggered \r\r\r\r Item type grouping:\r\r passwords [item_type = credential]\r\r secure_notes [item_type = secure_note]\r\r payments [item_type in (credit_card, paypal, bank_statement)]\r\r personal_info [item_type in (identity, email, phone, address, company, website)]\r\r ids [item_type in (id_card, social_security, driver_licence , passport, fiscal_statement)].\r\r\r\rWARNING: The structure shown here might not be fully implemented. Please check the implementation status here\r\rhttps://confluence.dashlane.com/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=350869743#ImplementationstatusofSharingandVaulttracking-vault_report",
